{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Shot</strong> is a top-down shooter set in the Wild West.<br>A former sheriff, enraged after his son is kidnapped, heads into the outlaw\u2019s den for revenge.<br>Gear up with a variety of weapons and prepare for one-shot kills.<br>A single mistake means death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One-Shot, One-Kill Gunfights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy dies in a single shot \u2014 but so do you.<br>Equip revolvers, bullets, focused shots, and trinkets to craft your unique loadout.<br>There\u2019s no need to unlock gear. Experiment with all kinds of builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Cover, No Tricks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All enemies are ready to shoot at you.<br>At least they\u2019re only using guns.<br>There are no walls to hide behind \u2014<br>but luckily, your bullets won\u2019t get stuck either.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790800?t=1752915806","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790800/299972aeb44d552f5373f615e12f24add55cdea8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752915806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790800/07900a432a8a1399e48e594049e021866a07831b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752915806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790800/07900a432a8a1399e48e594049e021866a07831b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752915806","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains realistic gunfights, graphic violence, and a dark, oppressive atmosphere.\r\nIt does not contain sexual content, drug use, self-harm, or depictions of sexual violence."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Shot</strong> is a top-down shooter set in the Wild West.<br>A former sheriff, enraged after his son is kidnapped, heads into the outlaw\u2019s den for revenge.<br>Gear up with a variety of weapons and prepare for one-shot kills.<br>A single mistake means death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One-Shot, One-Kill Gunfights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy dies in a single shot \u2014 but so do you.<br>Equip revolvers, bullets, focused shots, and trinkets to craft your unique loadout.<br>There\u2019s no need to unlock gear. Experiment with all kinds of builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Cover, No Tricks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All enemies are ready to shoot at you.<br>At least they\u2019re only using guns.<br>There are no walls to hide behind \u2014<br>but luckily, your bullets won\u2019t get stuck either.</p>","developers":["znlfxm"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790800/c5ae50ec2741ec5c64338d4fb9afbce5fa2d9344/header.jpg?t=1752915806","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3790800/682060918/2ee40d5d62f10930f68b057a61579d95ae7ee1cf/1751006535/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751595149","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3790800/682060918/2ee40d5d62f10930f68b057a61579d95ae7ee1cf/1751006535/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751595149","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3790800/682060918/2ee40d5d62f10930f68b057a61579d95ae7ee1cf/1751006535/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751595149","id":257162245,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162245/movie480.mp4?t=1751595149","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162245/movie_max.mp4?t=1751595149"},"name":"One_Shot","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.ste